<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will receive a recreation boost that last between 4 hours and 3 days that will raise their recreation bar. They'll also get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.\n\nThe ritual bonfire will stay lit for at least two quadrums, providing a beauty bonus nearby and counting towards the number of fires around for the Fire: Desired precept.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者将获得持续 4 小时到 3 天的娱乐提升，这将提高他们的娱乐标准。他们的情绪也会在 {MOODDAYS} 天内处于 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间。

仪式篝火将持续点燃至少两个方格，提供附近的美丽奖励，并计入“火：所需戒律”周围的火的数量。</VME_BonfireOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! Some pathetic little flames drifted around, and they went away too soon (no recreation effect applied).-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 太糟糕了！一些可怜的小火焰四处飘荡，但它们很快就消失了（没有应用娱乐效果）。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was lackluster. We were expecting a wondrous conflagration, and instead we got an oversized campfire. At least it was kinda entertaining.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 4 hours.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 表现平淡。我们原以为会发生一场奇妙的大火，但结果却是一场超大的篝火。至少还算有趣。

所有参与者的娱乐时间将提高4小时。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Lackluster-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>黯淡无光</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was good. The flames rose and crackled majestically over the settlement, and it lifted all our spirits considerably.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 1 day.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 很好。定居点上空熊熊燃烧，火焰噼啪作响，极大地振奋了我们的士气。

所有参与者的娱乐活动将提高 1 天。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Good-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>好的</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was glorious! It was super fun and we really connected with each other with the shared experience.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 3 days.-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 太棒了！这非常有趣，我们通过共同的经历真正建立了联系。

所有参与者的娱乐时间将提高 3 天。</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Glorious-->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>辉煌</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>参与者人数</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. All participants must be healthy to attend.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者的情绪将在 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间持续 {MOODDAYS} 天。所有参与者必须身体健康才能参加。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! The blade was thrust laterally and there was blood and entrails everywhere. Disgusting!-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 太糟糕了！刀刃是推力横向的，到处都是血和内脏。恶心！</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was boring. The speech seemed forced. At the very least we have restored the honor of our colony.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 很无聊。演讲看起来被迫。至少我们恢复了我们殖民地的荣誉。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无聊的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} has restored the honor of our colony. The shadow of defeat no longer clouds our minds.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 恢复了我们殖民地的荣誉。失败的阴影不再笼罩我们的心头。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Honorable-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>尊敬的</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was unforgettable! Everyone will remember the courage, self-control, and strong resolve. The honor of our colony is now spotless.-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 令人难忘！每个人都会记住勇气、自制力和坚强的决心。我们殖民地的荣誉现在一尘不染。</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Unforgettable-->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>难忘</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: Participants will get completely random results, with no regard for ritual quality.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>参与者将得到完全随机的结果，不考虑仪式的质量。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: Our destiny has been revealed by the stars.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>我们的命运已由星星揭示。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Inscrutable-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>深不可测</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: Our destiny has been revealed by the stars.-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>我们的命运已由星星揭示。</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Inscrutable-->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>深不可测</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: If the incantation ritual goes well (positive outcome) it will increase the corruption need of all participants by 20%, as well as provide a mood bonus.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.description>如果咒语仪式进行顺利（积极结果），它将增加所有参与者 20% 的腐败需求，并提供情绪奖励。</VME_IncantationOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was abnormal! An indescribably hideous gibbering! We'd even describe it as squamous, but we don't even know what that is! An unutterable word!-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}异常！一种难以形容的狰狞的胡言乱语！我们甚至将其描述为鳞状，但我们甚至不知道那是什么！一个说不出来的词！</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Squamous-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>鳞状</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was suitably accursed. A litany of dark morbidities expressed in crime, perversion, and insanity.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 受到了适当的诅咒。一连串的黑暗病态表现为犯罪、变态和精神错乱。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Accursed-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>被诅咒的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was blasphemous. A promise of hidden and fathomless worlds of strange life which pulsate in the gulfs beyond the stars and press hideously upon our own globe in unholy dimensions which only the dead and the moonstruck can glimpse.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 是亵渎神明的。一个充满奇异生命的隐藏而深不可测的世界的承诺，它们在群星之外的深渊中脉动，并以只有死者和月光中的人才能瞥见的邪恶尺寸可怕地压在我们自己的地球上。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Blasphemous-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>亵渎神灵</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was loathsome! We live on a placid island of ignorance in the midst of black seas of infinity, and it was not meant that we should voyage far.-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 太恶心了！我们生活在无边无际的黑海之中一座平静的无知岛屿上，这并不意味着我们应该远航。</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Loathsome-->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人厌恶的</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: chanter present-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>吟唱者在场</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者的情绪将在 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间持续 {MOODDAYS} 天。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was incredibly uninteresting. Yeah, yeah, insects are cool. Bah.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 非常无趣。是啊是啊，昆虫很酷。呸。

仪式对类昆虫牧民的筑巢能力没有影响。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Uninteresting-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>无趣</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was awkward. The speech was repetitive, and it did nothing to convince us of the divinity of our beloved insects.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 很尴尬。演讲是重复的，并没有让我们相信我们心爱的昆虫的神性。

仪式对类昆虫牧民的筑巢能力没有影响。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Awkward-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>尴尬的</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was very rousing. The chanter showed impressing skill and the hymn appropriately extolled the virtues of our way of life.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 非常振奋人心。吟唱者展现出令人印象深刻的技巧，圣歌恰当地歌颂了我们生活方式的美德。

仪式刷新了昆虫牧民筑巢能力的冷却时间。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Rousing-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>振奋人心</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was entrancing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the hymn, like a myriad insectile legs crawling all over our bodies.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.\n\nThe ritual also made any insectoids that were assaulting the colony flee.-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 令人着迷！我们仍然可以听到赞美诗中令人着迷的歌词，就像无数的昆虫腿在我们的全身爬行。

仪式刷新了昆虫牧民筑巢能力的冷却时间。

仪式也让任何袭击殖民地的昆虫都逃走了。</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Entrancing-->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人着迷</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s expectations-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>{PAWN_labelShort}的期望</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!--EN: If it goes well, target's ideoligion certainty will be reduced or they will convert. If it goes badly, they will gain certainty in their old beliefs.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>如果进展顺利，目标的意识形态确定性将会降低或者他们会转变。如果情况恶化，他们就会对自己的旧信念获得确定性。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible! From the first word, it was a fruitless back-and-forth argument. It dragged on for a cringe-inducingly long time.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 太糟糕了！从第一句话开始，就是一场没有结果的争论。它拖了很长时间，令人畏缩。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was ineffective. Most of the arguments were unclear, and the convertee countered those that made sense.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 无效。大多数论点都不清楚，而皈依者则反驳了那些有道理的论点。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Ineffective-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无效</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was effective. The speech not only delivered solid arguments and visibly swayed the convertee's thoughts, but kept the crowd entertained as well.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 有效。演讲不仅提出了坚实的论点，明显地改变了皈依者的思想，而且也让观众感到愉悦。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Effective-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>有效的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was masterful! Old beliefs seemed to dissolve effortlessly and inevitably, and our true knowledge was accepted.-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 太棒了！旧的信仰似乎毫不费力且不可避免地消失了，我们真正的知识被接受了。</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Masterful-->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>大师级的</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: challenge organizer present-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>挑战组织者在场</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>参与者人数</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者的情绪将在 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间持续 {MOODDAYS} 天。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was terrible! The fighters bumbled around, ineptly avoiding each other in a extended display of cowardice and weakness. Watching it just made people sad.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>领导力的挑战是可怕的！战士们笨手笨脚地四处走动，笨拙地互相躲避，长期表现出怯懦和软弱。光是看着就让人心酸。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was boring. The fighters wouldn't commit, so there were no exciting moments. At least our leader is the strongest.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>领导力挑战很无聊。战士们不会投入，所以没有激动人心的时刻。至少我们的领袖是最强的。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>无聊的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was good. The fighters went for blood and showed real heart. We now know that our leader is the strongest.-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>领导力挑战很好。战士们为血而奋斗，并表现出了真正的爱心。我们现在知道我们的领袖是最强的。</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Good-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>好的</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The leadership challenge was unforgettable! Both fighters gave all they had, and we know that our leader is now the strongest among us!-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>领导力挑战令人难忘！两位战士都竭尽全力，我们知道我们的领袖现在是我们之中最强的！</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Unforgettable-->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>难忘</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!--EN: orgy organizer present-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>狂欢组织者出席</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>房间令人印象深刻</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>参与者人数</VME_OrgyRitualOutcome.comps.3.label>
  <!--EN: Every participant will get a "got some lovin'" memory, but the negative effects of a bad quality orgy will be much more severe than usual. Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.\nNote that all participants must be consenting adults. If the moral guide is not an adult the ritual will appear as blocked.-->
